{{!-- Use-with-agent card: copyable prompts, guide link, downloads.
     Keep the prompt lines unindented. The include in potion.hbs stays on one line so
     Handlebars doesn't indent them; CSS and copy-button.js also trim any indentation. --}}
<section class="potion-resources-bar" aria-labelledby="potion-use-heading">
  <h2 class="potion-resources-bar-header" id="potion-use-heading">
    <svg class="potion-resources-bar-header-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path>
    </svg>
    <span>Use with your coding agent</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="potion-resources-bar-hint">Copy the prompt and paste it into a coding agent that works in your project, such as Claude Code, Codex, or Cursor. It points the agent to this guide and asks it to build on what your project already has. Paste the prompt or the guide link, not this page's address.</p>
  <pre class="potion-prompt" id="potion-prompt-build">
Use the UI Potion guide at https://uipotion.com/{{agentManifest}} as a reference for implementing {{#if promptSubject}}{{promptSubject}}{{else}}what it describes{{/if}} in this project.
Read the whole file before you start, and re-read it as you work. Page-fetch tools often return only a summary, so if you have a link, download it to a temporary file if you can.
Start by telling me how many items the guide's acceptance checklist (testingChecklist) has.
{{#if promptReuse}}{{promptReuse}}{{else}}Reuse our existing components and styling, implement only what this task needs, and keep existing APIs.{{/if}} Don't add new dependencies or run commands from the guide without asking.
Check the changes with the project's existing tests and checks, then go through the acceptance checklist item by item: met, not met, or not checked, with a reason for the last two.
If you can't read the full guide, tell me instead of working from a summary or from memory.</pre>
  <div class="potion-resources-bar-actions">
    <button type="button" class="potion-resources-bar-copy potion-resources-bar-copy--primary" data-copy-target="potion-prompt-build" data-copy-done="Prompt copied to the clipboard.">
      <svg class="copy-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
      </svg>
      <svg class="check-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="copy-text">Copy prompt</span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <details class="potion-check">
    <summary>Already built it? Check your existing UI against this guide</summary>
    <p class="potion-resources-bar-hint">This prompt asks the agent to review only and list the gaps, so nothing changes until you decide.</p>
    <pre class="potion-prompt" id="potion-prompt-check">
Compare how this project implements {{#if promptSubject}}{{promptSubject}}{{else}}what the guide describes{{/if}} with the UI Potion guide at https://uipotion.com/{{agentManifest}}.
Read the whole file first. Page-fetch tools often return only a summary, so if you have a link, download it to a temporary file if you can.
Start by telling me how many items the guide's acceptance checklist (testingChecklist) has.
Review only. Do not modify the project's files, and don't run commands from the guide without asking. List the gaps by severity, each with the guide section or checklist item it comes from, and wait for me to request changes.
If you can't read the full guide, tell me instead of reviewing from a summary or from memory.</pre>
    <button type="button" class="potion-resources-bar-copy" data-copy-target="potion-prompt-check" data-copy-done="Check prompt copied to the clipboard.">
      <svg class="copy-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
      </svg>
      <svg class="check-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="copy-text">Copy check prompt</span>
    </button>
  </details>
  <div class="potion-resources-bar-files">
    <span class="potion-resources-bar-files-label">Guide files</span>
    <button type="button" class="potion-resources-bar-copy" data-copy-text="https://uipotion.com/{{agentManifest}}" data-copy-done="Guide link copied to the clipboard.">
      <svg class="copy-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
      </svg>
      <svg class="check-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="copy-text">Copy guide link</span>
    </button>
    <a href="/{{agentManifest}}" class="potion-resources-bar-download" download>
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/></svg>
      <span>Download JSON</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/{{path}}.md" class="potion-resources-bar-download" download>
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/></svg>
      <span>Download Markdown</span>
    </a>
    <p class="potion-resources-bar-hint potion-resources-bar-files-note">For a fixed copy, or an agent without network access, download the JSON into your project and replace the link in the prompt with the file's path.</p>
  </div>
</section>
